  "description": "Jio, a mundane office worker with a bland and monotonous life, resembling low-fat milk. The only joy in his life is gaming, but everything changes when the ultra-gorgeous Soha appears before him. His dormant love cells awaken. Meanwhile, Yujin, a new employee at the company where Jio works, also secretly harbors feelings for him. Can the expert of timid one-sided love overcome their own limitations(?) and conquer love?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=818674), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10409381)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0003130)",
